#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid ""
"<p>Welcome aboard <b>Netzac Navigator 4.0</b> running on <b>ZacOS 9</b>.</p>"
"<p>Quick links to explore the classic &amp; text-friendly Web:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><a href='https://frogfind.com'>FrogFind!</a> &mdash; Classic search engine for retro browsers</li>"
"<li><a href='https://wiby.me'>Wiby</a> &mdash; Search engine for classic web pages</li>"
"<li><a href='http://68k.news'>68k.news</a> &mdash; Fast headlines formatted for classic Macs</li>"
"<li><a href='https://theoldnet.com'>The Old Net</a> &mdash; Browse snapshots of the 1990s web</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bem-vindo a bordo do <b>Netzac Navigator 4.0</b> no <b>ZacOS 9</b>.</p>"
"<p>Links rápidos para explorar a Web clássica e amigável a texto:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><a href='https://frogfind.com'>FrogFind!</a> &mdash; Buscador clássico para navegadores retrô</li>"
"<li><a href='https://wiby.me'>Wiby</a> &mdash; Mecanismo de busca para páginas clássicas</li>"
"<li><a href='http://68k.news'>68k.news</a> &mdash; Manchetes rápidas formatadas para Macs clássicos</li>"
"<li><a href='https://theoldnet.com'>The Old Net</a> &mdash; Navegue por registros da web dos anos 1990</li>"
"</ul>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "Netzac - Mail"
msgstr "Netzac - E-mail"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid ""
"<p><b>Netzac - Mail</b></p>"
"<p>To configure this button to open your mail link (for example Gmail or webmail), "
"open <b>Edit &rsaquo; Preferences &rsaquo; Quick Links</b> and set the <b>Mail URL</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Netzac - E-mail</b></p>"
"<p>Para configurar este botão para abrir seu serviço de e-mail (por exemplo Gmail ou webmail), "
"abra <b>Editar &rsaquo; Preferências &rsaquo; Links Rápidos</b> e defina a <b>URL do E-mail</b>.</p>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "Netzac - Chat"
msgstr "Netzac - Chat"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid ""
"<p><b>Netzac - Chat</b></p>"
"<p>To configure this button to open your chat service, "
"open <b>Edit &rsaquo; Preferences &rsaquo; Quick Links</b> and set the <b>Chat URL</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Netzac - Chat</b></p>"
"<p>Para configurar este botão para abrir seu serviço de chat, "
"abra <b>Editar &rsaquo; Preferências &rsaquo; Links Rápidos</b> e defina a <b>URL do Chat</b>.</p>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "Netzac - Git"
msgstr "Netzac - Git"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid ""
"<p><b>Netzac - Git</b></p>"
"<p>To configure this button to open your Git forge (for example GitHub, GitLab or Gitea), "
"open <b>Edit &rsaquo; Preferences &rsaquo; Quick Links</b> and set the <b>Git URL</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Netzac - Git</b></p>"
"<p>Para configurar este botão para abrir seu serviço Git (por exemplo GitHub, GitLab ou Gitea), "
"abra <b>Editar &rsaquo; Preferências &rsaquo; Links Rápidos</b> e defina a <b>URL do Git</b>.</p>"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "Netzac Navigator Help"
msgstr "Ajuda do Netzac Navigator"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts &amp; Toolbar Guide"
msgstr "Atalhos de Teclado e Guia das Barras"

#: shell/netzac/netzacwindow.cpp
msgid ""
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Collapse Toolbars:</b> Click the ribbed grip on the left of any toolbar.</li>"
"<li><b>Open Page:</b> <code>Ctrl+O</code></li>"
"<li><b>Find in Page:</b> <code>Ctrl+F</code> / Find Again: <code>Ctrl+G</code></li>"
"<li><b>Add Bookmark:</b> <code>Ctrl+D</code> / Manage: <code>Ctrl+B</code></li>"
"<li><b>Reload / Stop:</b> <code>Ctrl+R</code> / <code>Esc</code></li>"
"<li><b>Calm Mode:</b> <code>Ctrl+Shift+C</code></li>"
"<li><b>Page Source / Info:</b> <code>Ctrl+U</code> / <code>Ctrl+I</code></li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Recolher Barras:</b> Clique na alça canelada à esquerda de qualquer barra.</li>"
"<li><b>Abrir Página:</b> <code>Ctrl+O</code></li>"
"<li><b>Localizar na Página:</b> <code>Ctrl+F</code> / Próximo: <code>Ctrl+G</code></li>"
"<li><b>Adicionar Favorito:</b> <code>Ctrl+D</code> / Editar: <code>Ctrl+B</code></li>"
"<li><b>Recarregar / Parar:</b> <code>Ctrl+R</code> / <code>Esc</code></li>"
"<li><b>Modo Calmo:</b> <code>Ctrl+Shift+C</code></li>"
"<li><b>Código-Fonte / Info da Página:</b> <code>Ctrl+U</code> / <code>Ctrl+I</code></li>"
"</ul>"

